A. M. M. Maruf Hossain1,3*, M. Shahidul Islam2, M. Mustafa Mamun1, H. M. Al‑Jonaed1, M. Imran1,
M. Hasibur Rahman1, M. Azizul Islam Kazi2 and Syed Fazle Elahi1
*Correspondence:
mueed_abd@yahoo.com
1
Department of Soil, Water
