wiki/sources/deka2023-monitoring-strategies-heavy-metals-chapter.md:83:- FAAS family (FAAS, HGAAS, CVAAS) — accessible, lower sensitivity; HGAAS used for hydride-forming metals (As, Pb, Se, Sn); CVAAS for Hg.
