+- [[ingredients/cabbage]]
+- [[ingredients/spinach]]
+- [[ingredients/root-vegetables]]
+- [[ingredients/green-beans]]
+- [[ingredients/vegetables]]
+- [[products/root-tuber-vegetables]]
+- [[products/non-root-vegetables]]
+- [[products/leafy-vegetables-other]]
